Two integration details need changes to the plan: closing `QueryEvents`’ result channel still looks like successful completion to khatru, and `CheckSignature` does not validate the event’s supplied ID. I also confirmed that the rowid prune keeps one extra row and still walks the full offset. There’s no local ClickHouse server available, so I’m distinguishing source/documentation checks from runtime validation.
